1
00:02:24,716 --> 00:02:26,716


2
00:02:30,310 --> 00:02:31,310
Come in.

3
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:45,428
Good morning, Princess Bella. We will be in Silverland soon.

4
00:02:45,452 --> 00:02:48,241
I hate real food! Fruit juice is all I need!

5
00:02:48,265 --> 00:02:51,859
Um, won't you eat at least a little bit of something else—

6
00:02:52,259 --> 00:02:54,040
When I say I don't want it, I don't!

7
00:02:54,064 --> 00:02:56,420
Are you trying to turn me into a fat, hideous girl?

8
00:02:56,445 --> 00:02:58,580
O-Oh, no, of course not... Yes, ma'am.

9
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:01,580
Well then, excuse me...

10
00:03:14,864 --> 00:03:17,100
Mirror, mirror, answer me.

11
00:03:17,304 --> 00:03:19,380
Who is the most beautiful woman in the world?

12
00:03:21,090 --> 00:03:22,440
Hark, I shall answer.

13
00:03:24,100 --> 00:03:25,520
Listen carefully.

14
00:03:27,390 --> 00:03:33,380
I know not of the whole world, but the most beautiful in this land...

15
00:03:34,255 --> 00:03:34,841
Bella,

16
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,440
well, that would be you.

17
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:40,340
No matter where I go, there's no girl prettier than me.

18
00:03:40,910 --> 00:03:44,420
Still, I'm traveling around the world to make sure of it.

19
00:04:07,799 --> 00:04:08,893
11 of 'em!

20
00:04:11,820 --> 00:04:12,860
All right!

21
00:04:16,250 --> 00:04:18,540
Here goes, yee-haw!

22
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:21,180
Ha, how's that? That makes 12!

23
00:04:21,890 --> 00:04:24,206
Damn it, how frustrating!

24
00:04:37,390 --> 00:04:38,580
Blech!

25
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,800
How do you like that, Nylon?

26
00:04:43,465 --> 00:04:45,120
I-I won't yield!

27
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:52,080
Duralumin, you made me play this game hoping I'd break my neck, didn't you?

28
00:04:52,250 --> 00:04:53,240
Your plan backfired.

29
00:04:53,264 --> 00:04:54,180
What are you talking about?

30
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,885
I recommended it because it's a manly sport.

31
00:04:56,916 --> 00:04:59,986
Then since I won, that makes me a manly man.

32
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:00,940
Right, Duralumin?

33
00:05:01,135 --> 00:05:03,440
W-Well, yes, I suppose so.

34
00:05:07,735 --> 00:05:09,120
A manly man...

35
00:05:09,795 --> 00:05:11,880
Hmm, that seems a bit problematic.

36
00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:21,040
Wow, what a deluxe carriage!

37
00:05:23,110 --> 00:05:24,300
Oh, it has a kitchen!

38
00:05:30,570 --> 00:05:31,570
Is no one here yet?

39
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,960
But what an incredible carriage!

40
00:05:33,165 --> 00:05:34,400
It's like a Rolls-Royce!

41
00:05:40,260 --> 00:05:41,300
Is there someone further inside?

42
00:05:42,220 --> 00:05:43,220
This is amazing!

43
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:53,620
Wow, incredible!

44
00:06:08,784 --> 00:06:10,333
What a strange mirror.

45
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:20,300
Jop, the flowers we picked are to make perfume, alright?

46
00:06:20,405 --> 00:06:21,405
Understood.

47
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:36,660
Thief!

48
00:06:36,685 --> 00:06:37,840
I told you, I'm not!

49
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:39,293
Thief!

50
00:06:39,685 --> 00:06:41,120
S-Sorry, don't do anything rash!

51
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:42,840
Lady Bella!

52
00:06:44,039 --> 00:06:45,039
Why you...

53
00:06:49,573 --> 00:06:51,253
W-Wait!

54
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:55,500
Eww, what a dirty kid!

55
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:03,360
Sorry you had to see such a dirty kid.

56
00:07:05,460 --> 00:07:06,780
Mirror, answer me.

57
00:07:07,090 --> 00:07:09,160
Who is the most beautiful in the world?

58
00:07:09,161 --> 00:07:10,161
Huh?

59
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,800
I shall answer.

60
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:20,500
I don't know about the rest of the world, but Sapphire is the most beautiful in Silverland.

61
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:21,700
What did you say?

62
00:07:21,815 --> 00:07:23,040
What about me?

63
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:29,060
In every land we've visited, Bella, no girl was more beautiful than you.

64
00:07:30,010 --> 00:07:33,780
But here in Silverland, there is a beautiful princess named Sapphire.

65
00:07:34,490 --> 00:07:35,940
Sapphire is more beautiful than Bella.

66
00:07:36,870 --> 00:07:37,870
Sapphire?

67
00:07:38,350 --> 00:07:39,940
Where is she, this girl?

68
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,400
Sapphire!

69
00:08:15,010 --> 00:08:18,500
You must never let anyone find out that you're a girl.

70
00:08:18,890 --> 00:08:20,266
Yes, Mother.

71
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:33,500
Oh, poor princess.

72
00:08:35,499 --> 00:08:37,700
I've had enough of these troublesome laws.

73
00:08:38,145 --> 00:08:40,640
I want to raise her to be a fine woman.

74
00:08:41,375 --> 00:08:46,380
It's an ancient law of this kingdom. If broken, the people won't forgive it.

75
00:08:47,045 --> 00:08:48,466
Ah, Sapphire...

76
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:00,755
Sapphire?

77
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:02,880
Right, where is this girl named Sapphire?

78
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,740
There's the castle!

79
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:06,026
Sapphire is the princess of the castle.

80
00:09:06,375 --> 00:09:07,688
The princess of the castle?

81
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:10,159
We're going to the castle!

82
00:09:10,230 --> 00:09:11,163
Understood.

83
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:14,360
No, Sapphire is a boy!

84
00:09:14,475 --> 00:09:17,759
He's a strong prince, definitely not a girl!

85
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:19,500
What?

86
00:09:20,010 --> 00:09:21,280
Sapphire is a girl?

87
00:09:21,300 --> 00:09:23,013
Yes, my mirror told me...

88
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:24,500
...that Sapphire is a girl.

89
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:27,220
And a girl prettier than me, no less!

90
00:09:28,199 --> 00:09:29,973
A magic mirror told you?

91
00:09:30,445 --> 00:09:34,186
Ah, what incredible luck! A total windfall! I love you!

92
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:36,366
Now, take me to Princess Sapphire!

93
00:09:36,585 --> 00:09:39,753
I won't be satisfied until I see for myself which of us is more beautiful.

94
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,553
Very well. Understood.

95
00:09:41,635 --> 00:09:42,500
Coming, coming!

96
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,600
I'll let you meet her.

97
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,480
Hurry!

98
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,000
Yes, yes.

99
00:09:48,513 --> 00:09:51,359
Well now, this has turned into quite an interesting situation.

100
00:09:52,479 --> 00:09:54,346
I'll tear off Sapphire's mask!

101
00:09:56,420 --> 00:09:57,040
Nylon!

102
00:09:57,300 --> 00:09:58,473
Let's spar!

103
00:09:58,935 --> 00:10:00,093
My, if it isn't yesterday's thief...

104
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:02,680
Lord Sapphire...

105
00:10:05,205 --> 00:10:06,246
Sapphire... You...

106
00:10:06,782 --> 00:10:09,040
Come at me!

107
00:10:09,405 --> 00:10:11,335
But, well, I mean...

108
00:10:11,359 --> 00:10:12,421
Take this!

109
00:10:15,045 --> 00:10:16,328
Ow... that hurt.

110
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:17,759
Come on!

111
00:10:20,390 --> 00:10:22,420
You're as weak as a woman, Nylon.

112
00:10:26,900 --> 00:10:27,900
How's that?

113
00:10:28,155 --> 00:10:29,300
I-I yield...

114
00:10:30,165 --> 00:10:31,779
Face up or face down? Which will it be?

115
00:10:32,460 --> 00:10:33,661
Face up or face down? Face up...!

116
00:10:34,229 --> 00:10:35,240
Then look me in the eye!

117
00:10:37,909 --> 00:10:39,160
Hello, young lady.

118
00:10:39,540 --> 00:10:40,540
Sorry about yesterday.

119
00:10:40,695 --> 00:10:41,840
I'm Prince Sapphire.

120
00:10:43,904 --> 00:10:47,360
You know, you're really beautiful. Man, you drive me crazy.

121
00:10:47,639 --> 00:10:49,180
You're so gorgeous.

122
00:10:50,789 --> 00:10:52,700
Um... are you really a boy?

123
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,360
Of course I am.

124
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:57,480
That's why a gorgeous girl like you drives me wild.

125
00:10:59,379 --> 00:11:02,460
Look, Sapphire is just a filthy boy.

126
00:11:03,239 --> 00:11:06,620
There's no way a girl prettier than me exists.

127
00:11:14,765 --> 00:11:17,560
Mirror, mirror, answer without teasing me.

128
00:11:17,785 --> 00:11:19,393
Who is the prettiest of all?

129
00:11:20,145 --> 00:11:21,580
That would be Sapphire.

130
00:11:22,770 --> 00:11:24,220
Sapphire is a boy.

131
00:11:24,470 --> 00:11:25,880
Are you still teasing me?

132
00:11:25,979 --> 00:11:28,140
No, Sapphire is a girl.

133
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:31,280
A girl prettier than Bella.

134
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:39,420
What? Lady Bella, do you still intend to keep traveling?

135
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:42,240
Yes, but there's something I must do first.

136
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,840
And that is?

137
00:11:44,619 --> 00:11:47,740
I'll stay in this kingdom until the magic mirror says I'm the most beautiful.

138
00:11:47,845 --> 00:11:50,020
Yes, yes, I understand completely!

139
00:11:50,300 --> 00:11:53,300
Allow me to offer my assistance then.

140
00:11:53,739 --> 00:11:54,739
Yes, very well.

141
00:11:55,535 --> 00:11:58,900
Then let me guide you to the finest hotel in Silverland.

142
00:11:59,649 --> 00:12:02,560
Jop, I will be staying at the House of Mirrors for a while.

143
00:12:02,805 --> 00:12:04,320
Ah, right away, ma'am.

144
00:12:04,465 --> 00:12:05,465
I'll build it immediately.

145
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,480
Build it?

146
00:12:07,610 --> 00:12:08,900
Build a mansion right away?

147
00:12:10,055 --> 00:12:12,466
Do you expect me to stay in some ordinary hotel?

148
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,220
Come to the House of Mirrors.

149
00:12:14,335 --> 00:12:15,340
We'll discuss it there.

150
00:12:16,969 --> 00:12:21,386
With that girl Bella around, Sapphire's secret might get exposed.

151
00:12:23,359 --> 00:12:26,240
You have to act even more like a boy than usual.

152
00:12:26,949 --> 00:12:30,020
Hey Tink, what's the best way to look like a real boy?

153
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:34,440
To look like a real boy? Fighting, obviously!

154
00:12:34,545 --> 00:12:36,346
Hmm, fighting...

155
00:12:42,572 --> 00:12:43,106
Sapphire!

156
00:12:46,596 --> 00:12:48,070
Well, look who just walked in.

157
00:12:48,410 --> 00:12:49,956
What a cheeky brat.

158
00:12:50,776 --> 00:12:52,776
A youngster’s come in, has he?

159
00:12:58,043 --> 00:12:58,690
What do you want?

160
00:12:58,836 --> 00:13:00,836
You insolent brat, I'll knock your teeth out!

161
00:13:02,375 --> 00:13:03,515
Well? Had enough?

162
00:13:10,621 --> 00:13:11,621
Take that!

163
00:13:11,729 --> 00:13:12,920
You cowardly fools!

164
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:17,886
Keep it up Sapphire!

165
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,375
Bella's watching!

166
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,360
You've got to be more over the top!

167
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:27,620
Okay!

168
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:28,620
Okay!

169
00:13:28,621 --> 00:13:30,140
Oh, but she's a girl.

170
00:13:30,460 --> 00:13:31,460
Indeed.

171
00:13:35,875 --> 00:13:37,199
Alright, this is it!

172
00:13:37,775 --> 00:13:38,960
She could get hurt here.

173
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:44,060
Just as I thought!

174
00:13:56,429 --> 00:13:57,580
How wonderful, Your Highness.

175
00:13:57,945 --> 00:14:01,846
Man, if I'd known you were watching, I'd have put on a bigger show.

176
00:14:03,629 --> 00:14:07,153
Say, won't you come visit my villa? You'd be most welcome.

177
00:14:07,540 --> 00:14:08,540
Villa?

178
00:14:08,939 --> 00:14:10,700
Yes, it's called the House of Mirrors.

179
00:14:10,815 --> 00:14:11,815
The House of Mirrors?

180
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:12,840
I've never heard of it.

181
00:14:12,955 --> 00:14:15,366
Of course not. I'm about to build it now.

182
00:14:15,959 --> 00:14:17,078
About to build it?

183
00:14:17,389 --> 00:14:19,060
Yes, it'll be built in just five minutes.

184
00:14:19,210 --> 00:14:19,971
Come on in.

185
00:14:19,995 --> 00:14:22,080
Sounds fun, I'm going!

186
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,320
Be careful!

187
00:14:24,060 --> 00:14:25,280
It might be a trap.

188
00:14:27,189 --> 00:14:30,346
But I have to go back to the castle and study.

189
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:33,446
Well, studying doesn't suit a boy anyway.

190
00:14:35,495 --> 00:14:36,213
I won't!

191
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,686
I'm not gonna study!

192
00:14:38,069 --> 00:14:39,519
Then come on in.

193
00:14:49,039 --> 00:14:49,861
Right here is good.

194
00:14:49,885 --> 00:14:50,785
Understood.

195
00:15:23,980 --> 00:15:25,706
There, all done. Now go on home.

196
00:15:26,290 --> 00:15:27,800
That sure was fast.

197
00:15:28,060 --> 00:15:29,060
Ugh, it's creepy.

198
00:15:31,329 --> 00:15:33,481
Oh, are you scared? And you're supposed to be a boy!

199
00:15:34,238 --> 00:15:35,520
I-I'm not scared!

200
00:15:36,229 --> 00:15:37,860
Wait in the next room, okay?

201
00:15:37,946 --> 00:15:39,020
Okay!

202
00:15:40,870 --> 00:15:42,780
Most kids would have fainted by now.

203
00:15:43,025 --> 00:15:43,706
Just you wait.

204
00:15:58,680 --> 00:15:59,680
A mirror...?

205
00:16:20,389 --> 00:16:23,435
Call the maids! Dress Sapphire in a gown, put makeup on her,

206
00:16:24,486 --> 00:16:27,053
and then we'll see which of us is more beautiful!

207
00:16:27,955 --> 00:16:29,061
Right away.

208
00:16:36,919 --> 00:16:38,240
Her makeup is finished.

209
00:16:44,739 --> 00:16:45,739
A princess...?

210
00:16:45,969 --> 00:16:47,320
I hate to admit it, but she really is beautiful.

211
00:16:54,715 --> 00:16:55,800
Mirror, mirror...

212
00:16:55,945 --> 00:16:57,180
Tell me once more.

213
00:16:57,705 --> 00:16:59,260
Which of us is the fairer?

214
00:17:01,249 --> 00:17:02,840
That's already quite obvious.

215
00:17:03,825 --> 00:17:05,960
No matter how many times you ask, the answer remains the same.

216
00:17:06,539 --> 00:17:09,073
Sapphire is far prettier than Bella.

217
00:17:18,313 --> 00:17:19,313
How humiliating...


218
00:17:19,421 --> 00:17:19,967
At your service!

219
00:17:21,569 --> 00:17:23,119
Get rid of Sapphire.

220
00:17:23,859 --> 00:17:24,859
As you wish.

221
00:17:25,164 --> 00:17:27,200
Any girl prettier than me must be punished!

222
00:17:37,646 --> 00:17:38,520
Wait!

223
00:17:39,679 --> 00:17:42,300
Jop, send Sapphire to the grave with your own hands!

224
00:17:47,659 --> 00:17:48,659
Go, Opal!

225
00:18:55,929 --> 00:18:57,040
Here I come!

226
00:19:33,009 --> 00:19:34,280
How about that, mirror on the wall?!

227
00:19:50,780 --> 00:19:51,780
Bella!

228
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:52,880
Bella!

229
00:19:53,900 --> 00:19:54,900
The mansion is collapsing!

230
00:19:54,970 --> 00:19:55,970
We have to get out of here, fast!

231
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:57,160
Bella!

232
00:20:12,740 --> 00:20:13,286
Bella!

233
00:20:13,569 --> 00:20:16,200
Bella, you're awful enough to kill someone who came to rescue you!

234
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:17,360
Silence!

235
00:20:17,619 --> 00:20:19,460
You'll die right along with this building!

236
00:20:19,784 --> 00:20:22,940
Now... now I can be the prettiest girl once again!

237
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:24,440
Mirror, let's go.

238
00:20:26,019 --> 00:20:27,400
Ah, it's cracking...

239
00:20:31,760 --> 00:20:32,760
Why?

240
00:20:32,794 --> 00:20:34,140
Why is it breaking?!

241
00:20:39,199 --> 00:20:39,997
Bella...

242
00:20:40,608 --> 00:20:41,800
you are ugly.

243
00:20:42,499 --> 00:20:43,499
I've had enough!

244
00:20:44,265 --> 00:20:47,486
I'm sick of reflecting a girl as ugly as you.

245
00:20:55,653 --> 00:20:56,653
Bella!

246
00:20:58,926 --> 00:20:59,759
Bella!

247
00:21:09,406 --> 00:21:09,900
Bella!

248
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:11,160
Bella!

249
00:21:41,520 --> 00:21:42,520
Bella!

250
00:21:43,009 --> 00:21:45,152
Bella, this is what you look like!

251
00:21:45,176 --> 00:21:46,193
 That's a lie!

252
00:21:47,429 --> 00:21:49,880
This is your true form!

253
00:21:57,379 --> 00:21:57,833
Bella!

254
00:21:58,040 --> 00:22:00,100
What should I do... What should I do...

255
00:22:01,099 --> 00:22:02,980
Bella, you must possess a beautiful heart.

256
00:22:04,214 --> 00:22:07,400
An ugly heart is what makes you ugly.

257
00:22:08,293 --> 00:22:11,220
You must have a heart as beautiful as Sapphire's.

258
00:22:22,556 --> 00:22:23,116
Bella!

259
00:22:23,140 --> 00:22:24,140
Watch out!

260
00:22:27,060 --> 00:22:27,573
Hurry!

261
00:22:56,739 --> 00:22:57,940
Goodbye, Bella.

262
00:22:58,969 --> 00:23:00,000
Goodbye, Sapphire.

263
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:01,160
Take care.

264
00:23:01,540 --> 00:23:02,540
Here, a present.

265
00:23:02,694 --> 00:23:04,420
Girls love makeup, after all.

266
00:23:05,745 --> 00:23:06,460
Oh, thank you!

267
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:07,720
It's a mirror...

268
00:23:09,845 --> 00:23:10,845
Now, go!

269
00:23:40,928 --> 00:23:43,328
Goodbye!

270
00:23:47,624 --> 00:23:49,624

